{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04298","headline":"奉和圣制夏日游石淙山 · 张易之","name":"奉和圣制夏日游石淙山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"六龙骧首晓駸駸，七圣陪轩集颍阴。\n千丈松萝交翠幕，一丘山水当鸣琴。\n青鸟白云王母使，垂藤断葛野人心。\n山中日暮幽岩下，泠然香吹落花深。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张易之","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04298.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04298","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}